BOOKbangla 1.0.1 — Writing Bangla and Assamese books with memoir

Write your Bangla or Assamese book with familiar LaTeX commands, styled chapter headings,
worked examples, exercises with hints and chapter quotations. BOOKbangla builds
on memoir and LaTeXbangla: choose your fonts and bibliography style, and use
memoir's commands to adapt the layout to your book.

Bangla is the default; select language=assamese for an Assamese book.
Read bookbangla.pdf for usage and examples in English, Bangla and Assamese.
Install the class with its code/ folder in your local TeX tree,
or copy them beside your document. Compile with XeLaTeX or LuaLaTeX,
using an updated TeX Live 2024 or later and LaTeXbangla 2.0.1 or newer.

